#, c-format
msgid ""
"\"%s\" ends in an unfinished save -- whatever was writing it stopped "
"partway. The unfinished part was set aside; this file opens at the last "
"complete save."
msgstr ""
"\"%s\" は保存が完了しないまま終わっています -- 書き込んでいた処理が途中で停止"
